      "Gagizhibaajiwan",
      "Contact Me",
      "Hi! This is Nupur Bosmiya. I'm a journalist and a photographer. I recently graduated from DePaul University with a master's degree in Journalism, where I worked with the newspaper, the bilingual publication and the magazine to tell stories ranging from arts and culture to local and national politics.\n\nI am now excited to explore longer-form storytelling and community journalism that goes beyond the confines of geography. My interests lie specifically in niche art communities and practices. If you would like to collaborate with me, please feel free to reach out! \n\nMy contact information is available below, or you can navigate to the 'Contact Me' form on the far right of the menu bar.",
